`QueryKind`, `CompileKind` and `CompileTarget` without the constructors
that run `rustc`, `Value` and `Definition`, `CargoResult` and
`InternalError`, `PollExt`, `is_embedded` and `version()`. Each is Cargo's
text with the Cargo-only parts left out; the files they come from are
listed under `[drift]` in `sync/config.toml`, so a sync reports upstream
changes to them.

